WEBVTT

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.520
Alright, let's keep our voices up for the match!

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.650
Focus! If you let your guard down, they'll send us to the cleaners!

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.670
Side-backs, stick close to Katayama and Hatake.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:01.280
Yes!

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:05.870
Alright, I'm calm.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:14.670
I'll show you! I'll show you! I'll show you!

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:19.670
Sera's fired up, but he looks kinda scary.

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.680
Listen up, we did everything we could.

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:31.360
Now we just have to show it on the pitch!

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:35.860
We'll defeat Osaka. Let's go!

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:36.940
Yeah!

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:39.820
Just you watch.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:47.410
I'm going to snap your stuck-up nose in the next 90 minutes, Dulfer.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.580
So, they're using man-to-man marking?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.680
I commend your spirit, Tatsumi...

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:09.650
but do you really think this will be enough to contain my players?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.310
Kubotan!

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.540
Sugie is marking Kubota?

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:26.070
Then who's marking Hauer?

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:33.070
Problem?

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.200
What's this?

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:38.160
This isn't what Coach said.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:43.870
Shouldn't No.3 be the one marking me?

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:47.600
Why is it...

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.970
What are you looking at?

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:55.380
...this unrefined brat?

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:59.750
Can Kuro really take on Hauer?

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.480
The difference in height is too great!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:06.480
Just shut up and watch!

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:09.560
Telling his fans to shut up...

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.490
How could he hear us from there?

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.920
It's only a 20cm difference.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.840
This actually gets me more fired up.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:32.870
Sugie on Kubota... Kuroda on Hauer...

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:36.820
That's quite a audacious match-up, Tatsumi.

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:41.270
Don't get put off by this, Shimura.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:44.520
Show them how bad these match-ups are.

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.110
It's a weird match-up...

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.400
But...

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:51.940
let's see what happens when I cross the ball in.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.170
That's spot on!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.410
Hauer, pass it here!

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.170
Katayama's coming, Kiyokawa!

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:06.420
Got it!

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:10.180
Stop me if you can!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:16.500
I can't afford to lose out in a one-on-one duel!

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.180
Don't let him pass you, Kiyokawa!

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:24.810
He's faster than I thought, but...

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.820
A feint and he's left biting dust...

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:37.990
Hey, Kubota!

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:41.650
I won't let the ball reach Hauer!

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:45.580
Uhh...

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:47.780
This way.

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:59.150
It went over!

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.470
That was close!

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.680
Hey, Hatake!

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:15.360
Why did you shoot, you fool? What were you thinking?

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:19.220
Why? Because I'm the ace striker after all.

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.240
Don't be such a loser!

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.200
You, the ace?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.700
What, you want a fight?!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.900
They're getting into our half already.

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:32.470
Will we be okay?

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.010
That was dangerous indeed.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:41.270
M-Manager! Where's your confidence?

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.870
I-It's right here.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.810
But I thought that we'd have the upper hand...

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.940
since we had an extra day to rest.

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:56.640
As I thought, teams on a winning streak do look different.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:00.170
They're picking up where they left off during the last game.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:09.540
This giant brat...

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:13.660
I'll get dominated if I play my usual game.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:17.910
I've got to assess the situation and plan ahead accordingly.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:22.870
Oops, sorry.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:24.970
Hey, you.

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:29.940
You're bumping into me too often.

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.440
What're you saying?

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.820
Don't you know?

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:41.530
As a pro, you're being closely watched.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:45.450
I pay attention to how I present myself,

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.450
so can you stop messing up my hair?

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:55.500
If you're really a pro, you should do something about it...

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.760
Your head.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:06.410
I... I got that.

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:09.980
That transcended the language barrier!

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:11.700
You're one to talk!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:17.230
You're a guy! Yet you have that disgusting hairstyle!

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:22.610
I kind of got that.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:26.830
You mocked me, right?

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.620
What, you wanna fight?!

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:37.130
Are Kuroda and Hauer chatting, or fighting? They look busy.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.380
Kuro's not too shabby. He held up well on his own.

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:47.720
I'm counting on you. The fate of the first half lies in your hands.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:53.020
Alright, let's show them what we've got!

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:59.550
That's too much, it'll hit the sideline.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.160
This guy's from the back!

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.520
That's too bad.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:13.040
It would've been a good chance.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:19.130
He has great feet... No.7, Tsubaki.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:25.360
I guess I have to watch out for this guy.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.560
Sorry, Baki.

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:34.690
He miscued it? That's unlike him.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:41.120
He did miss the last game because of his foot injury though.

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:43.770
Could it be...

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:00.590
Hey, Shimura, pass me the ball!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:01.910
What?

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.920
This prick, I'm gonna trounce him!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:06.740
Like I'll lose to you, you idiot!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:10.260
Hmm, did the two of you become friends?

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:18.350
You can't be too friendly during the match.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:20.860
Here it is!

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:30.120
Bring it on!

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:31.620
Fight!

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:36.830
He's in position. Don't lose your man!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:40.080
Give me the ball!

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:41.590
Hauer!

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:48.720
It's here!

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.030
They're attacking!

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:51.960
Kuroda!

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:53.720
Stay calm.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.740
Good work, Kuroda!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.490
Did you see that, you shit head?

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.260
Loose ball!

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:18.620
Nice, Kubo!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:25.250
You bastard.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:31.930
Nice defending, Kiyokawa.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:40.450
Good anticipation, Kiyokawa. Well done.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:49.410
Hey, your precious hair's messed up. Are you scared or something?

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.910
This guy's making fun of me again!

00:12:56.930 --> 00:13:03.670
This guy's just like the manager mentioned... He's bad with his feet.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.750
He's got a wider reach and he's taller than me,

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:11.680
but what's crucial in defense is timing and positioning.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:15.200
If I don't screw that up, I'll win!

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:19.840
I'll show you what's really important for centre backs.

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:32.320
Interesting...

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.620
At first glance, they seem soft and sweet...

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.960
but on the inside they're not too fluffy.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.960
These donuts are quite tasty.

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:47.960
What? You were talking about the donuts?

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:54.470
I've been feeling it for awhile now... this strange attraction.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:58.180
Are those donuts really that good?

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.600
I'm not talking about the donuts! I'm talking about this match!

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:06.140
I don't quite link up with this guy...

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:10.230
Geez! What I'm talking about...

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:15.870
...is him! That Osaka player!

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:23.940
I think we've survived the first few minutes.

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:27.650
We can finally get into the game...

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.250
I wish that was the case,

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:35.120
but we haven't got everything in control.

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:38.380
We've got to do that first,

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:42.170
otherwise we'll be playing right into their hands.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:51.790
Crap, he's realized that, too.

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:57.070
Alright, they should be warmed up by now.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:03.370
ETU haven't been really able to fend off our attacks.

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:06.170
The ball's in our court.

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:11.920
It's time to pile on the pressure!

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:18.160
Show them our proud footballing spirit!

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:25.060
Show them the diamond that has been perfected into beauty!

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:49.210
Dulfer is sending out "Attack, Attack" signals.

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:03.420
Alright, all four of them share the same sentiments.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:10.210
Shimura... Osaka's attacks always start from his precise passes.

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.670
If I can put him off here...

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:14.360
Shimu!

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:20.140
Even a half-hearted one is enough...

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:27.200
because Hauer's ball control is excellent.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.090
Damn!

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:33.010
Yeah!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.460
Beat him!

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:37.210
Hauer, here!

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:41.220
Katayama is charging in! Don't lose him, Kiyokawa!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:50.720
It's not for Katayama, it's Hatake!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.690
Alright!

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:56.110
I won't let you shoot!

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:02.200
That's too weak, clear it!

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:06.120
This is where it begins, Tatsumi.

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:11.790
The might of our football.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:17.080
Osaka's got the ball again!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:18.840
Kubota got it!

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:27.680
What's with this guy?

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:30.620
He runs with the ball in a strange, unpredictable way.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:36.230
Tsubaki, trap him!

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:49.120
He nutmegged Sugie!

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:52.860
It's Katayama!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:53.750
Stop him!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:18:01.760
Watch this! This is my first goal in today's hat-trick!

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:08.890
That was close!

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:10.640
It's not over yet.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:16.400
The one with the deciding factor is me, Kata!

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:25.010
What the hell are you doing? I'm gonna kill you, Hatake!

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:28.160
Are you stupid? That's my line!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.660
Clear it! Clear it! Get it out!

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.140
Kubota...

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:52.990
They keep getting the loose balls.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:55.190
We've got to snatch it and calm things down.

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:03.790
What the hell is going on?

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.330
We can't retain the ball at all!

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:08.700
Do something, Tatsumi!

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:13.700
Osaka's attack is indeed scary,

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:19.710
but we've still managed to survive waves of attacks by them.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.810
The players are focused.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:26.970
The game will definitely turn in our favour.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.380
It will be alright.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:33.700
We've trained hard to prepare for this match.

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:38.730
That's it, Akasaki! Stick to him!

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:40.450
Alright.

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:50.450
ETU's got a pretty focused defense.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.870
However,

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:59.340
how long they can keep it up?

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:01.040
Exactly.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:08.130
Defenders usually let their guard down once the ball is cleared.

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:15.120
If the opponent keeps receiving the ball, then they're bound to lose focus eventually.

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:18.640
It's only a matter of time.

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:22.650
Then we've got them cornered.

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:28.070
The essence of Osaka Gunners' offensive style...

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:32.370
is to dominate possession in the opponent's half.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:46.190
Short centre backs like me simply can't afford to lose to someone like you!

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:50.680
Alright! You won't lose, Kuroda!

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:58.160
Damn, they're still coming?

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:02.720
Come on! Focus! Focus!

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:05.130
If I let my guard down, it'll be over,

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:12.030
but this guy's only trying to beat me with speed.

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:14.300
I can handle this.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:21.750
I only need to get the timing right when he attacks.

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.090
You're quite fast.

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:31.090
I can't win against you with speed.

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.150
Which is why...

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:38.630
He's shooting?

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.530
Kiyokawa got beaten!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.290
Crap!

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:53.410
Fool! You fell for it!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.530
He's cutting in, Dori!

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:01.290
Damn! Kiyokawa, you idiot!

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.420
Kuro, don't leave your man!

00:22:05.680 --> 00:22:07.310
Katayama's coming!

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:08.680
Don't let him pass!

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:13.050
Bring it. I'll stop you!

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:15.680
Don't take the bait! Watch Hauer, Kuro!

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:23.030
A dink!

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:48.460
Tch...

00:24:15.570 --> 00:24:17.670
I'm different today.

00:24:17.670 --> 00:24:19.010
You're dwelling on the ball for far too long!

00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:22.050
Your showtime's over!

00:24:22.260 --> 00:24:25.300
Making use of that immense talent in the forward position...

00:24:26.080 --> 00:24:28.260
Not too bad, Dulfer.
